    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d411">

                <pb facs="0779" n="751" sameAs="frus:frus1955-57v15/pg751"/>

                <head>411. Memorandum From the Director of Central Intelligence (Dulles) to the
                    Secretary of State<anchor n="1" xml:id="d411-f1"/></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1956-06-27"><hi rendition="#italic">June 27,
                        1956</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <list subtype="subject" type="description">
                    <label>SUBJECT</label>
                    <item>Shepilov’s Visit to Egypt …</item>
                </list>
                <p>The attached report summarizes the information on the Shepilov visit to Egypt
                    ….</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#bold">Allen W. Dulles</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d411-a1.xml" xpointer="d411-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d411-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d411-f1-content">
                <p>Source: Department of State, Central Files, 661.74/6–2756. Secret. The source
                    text bears a notation that Secretary Dulles saw this memorandum and its
                    enclosure.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
